==Battleground==
*24 [[Croco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*16 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Devil (Enemy)|Super Devil]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Satanmaria (Enemy)|Satanmaria]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

